    "implementation_delta": "Remove Datasets import-time auto-install. Package import no longer calls _enable_default_auto_install, get_installer, or ensure_repo_installer_current. The package-root installer stand-in is _InertInstaller (auto_install=False). ensure_module resolves via importlib only; missing optional modules stay None / typed unavailable. ipfs_backend_router._auto_install_enabled is fail-closed when env is unset. Explicit installation remains python -m ipfs_datasets_py.auto_installer or initialize_datasets. Live solvers remain typed unavailable. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
